{"id": "en_tornado_home_p2", "total": 71.55, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. The torn basement door exposes Jack to violent winds and heavy falling roof beams.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.24}, {"text": "Jack stays calm inside his sturdy basement shelter while the storm destroys the upper floor.", "start": 5.78, "end": 9.24}, {"text": "Falling debris threatens his position, forcing him to adapt quickly to survive the collapse.", "start": 9.82, "end": 13.5}, {"text": "One. Go to the basement, or an interior room on the lowest floor with no windows.", "start": 13.321, "end": 17.92}, {"text": "Jack crawls deeper into the basement corner, far away from any open broken doorway.", "start": 18.52, "end": 21.92}, {"text": "Two. Put as many walls as possible between you and the outside storm right now.", "start": 21.650000000000002, "end": 26.6}, {"text": "He pulls a heavy workbench between himself and the incoming debris for extra defense.", "start": 27.12, "end": 30.4}, {"text": "Three. Cover your head and neck with your arms, a mattress or strong protective helmets.", "start": 30.150000000000002, "end": 35.04}, {"text": "Jack pulls his thick mattress tightly over his head and neck to absorb heavy impacts.", "start": 35.64, "end": 38.7}, {"text": "He stays down in a tight crouch position as ceiling beams smash around his shelter.", "start": 39.2, "end": 42.62}, {"text": "Remember that mobile homes and cars are not safe, so finding sturdy shelter is critical.", "start": 43.16, "end": 46.88}, {"text": "The roaring tornado winds finally pass, leaving the neighborhood completely destroyed around his house.", "start": 47.46, "end": 51.52}, {"text": "Jack remains safe under the mattress because he covered his head and stayed underground.", "start": 52.2, "end": 55.26}, {"text": "He carefully pushes away the light debris and inspects his surroundings for lingering structural hazards.", "start": 55.74, "end": 59.7}, {"text": "His smart actions and strict safety choices kept him alive during the powerful violent tornado.", "start": 60.2, "end": 64.28}, {"text": "Cover your head and stay underground during tornados. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 64.98, "end": 68.4}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.36], ["two.", 0.239, 0.477], ["The", 1.28, 1.66], ["torn", 1.66, 1.88], ["basement", 1.88, 2.14], ["door", 2.14, 2.38], ["exposes", 2.38, 2.84], ["Jack", 2.84, 3.08], ["to", 3.08, 3.26], ["violent", 3.26, 3.56], ["winds", 3.56, 3.84], ["and", 3.84, 4.04], ["heavy", 4.04, 4.4], ["falling", 4.4, 4.76], ["roof", 4.76, 5.0], ["beams.", 5.0, 5.24], ["Jack", 5.78, 6.04], ["stays", 6.04, 6.24], ["calm", 6.24, 6.46], ["inside", 6.46, 6.76], ["his", 6.47, 5.729], ["sturdy", 6.9, 7.1], ["basement", 7.1, 7.3], ["shelter", 7.3, 7.7], ["while", 7.7, 7.88], ["the", 7.88, 7.98], ["storm", 7.98, 8.18], ["destroys", 8.18, 8.58], ["the", 8.58, 8.86], ["upper", 8.86, 8.98], ["floor.", 8.98, 9.24], ["Falling", 9.82, 10.18], ["debris", 10.18, 10.36], ["threatens", 10.36, 10.74], ["his", 10.74, 10.92], ["position,", 10.92, 11.3], ["forcing", 11.64, 11.82], ["him", 11.82, 11.96], ["to", 11.96, 12.02], ["adapt", 12.02, 12.24], ["quickly", 12.24, 12.68], ["to", 12.68, 12.84], ["survive", 12.84, 13.1], ["the", 13.1, 13.26], ["collapse.", 13.26, 13.5], ["One.", 13.321, 13.559], ["Go", 15.04, 15.14], ["to", 15.14, 15.22], ["the", 15.22, 15.3], ["basement,", 15.3, 15.56], ["or", 15.56, 15.8], ["an", 15.8, 15.86], ["interior", 15.86, 16.16], ["room", 16.16, 16.46], ["on", 16.46, 16.58], ["the", 16.58, 16.68], ["lowest", 16.68, 16.92], ["floor", 16.92, 17.22], ["with", 17.22, 17.4], ["no", 17.4, 17.62], ["windows.", 17.62, 17.92], ["Jack", 18.52, 18.74], ["crawls", 18.74, 18.98], ["deeper", 18.98, 19.24], ["into", 19.24, 19.46], ["the", 19.46, 19.58], ["basement", 19.58, 19.78], ["corner,", 19.78, 20.08], ["far", 20.36, 20.48], ["away", 20.48, 20.66], ["from", 20.66, 20.78], ["any", 20.78, 20.98], ["open", 20.98, 21.28], ["broken", 21.46, 21.64], ["doorway.", 21.64, 21.92